id: arrogant-and-unstoppable
name: Arrogant and Unstoppable
description: >
  Your power is so great that none can think to oppose you.
text: >
  Arrogant and Unstoppable: Your power is so great that none can think to oppose you.
  (1)-[Passive]: While in the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Combat Rolls, Soak Value, and Might by 2(T).
  (2)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: You may treat yourself as if you are in the Healthy Health Threshold for all of your effects until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1) Healthy - or counted as Healthy by (2), which every effect asking the Health Threshold reads (conditions.mjs belowThreshold).
if (!belowThreshold("bruised")) {
    combatRolls += 2(T);
    soakValue += 2(T);
    might += 2(T);
}

# (2) Using the Power Up Maneuver, once an Encounter: Healthy for all of your effects till the start of your next turn - its mark.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter, effect 2]
gain("arrogant-unstoppable-mark");
expires("arrogant-unstoppable-mark", start-of-next-turn);
